Fairy Tale Field is one of the fields present in Rejuvenation. It is categorized as a Magical field. 

==Transitions From Other Fields==

* [[Dragon's Den]] will transform into this field if Mist Ball is used.
** ''The mist-ical energy altered the surroundings!''

==General Effects==

* Dragon-type moves increase in base power by 2x.
** ''The foul beast's attack gained strength!''
* Steel-type moves increase in base power by 1.5x and hit Dragon-types super-effectively.
** ''For justice!''
* Fairy-type moves increase in base power by 1.5x.
** ''For ever after!''
* Slicing moves increase in base power by 1.5x.
** ''The blade cuts true!''
* Fire-type moves gain a Dragon sub-typing.


==Abilities Affected==

* Armor Tail, Battle Armor, and Shell Armor additionally boost the bearer's Defense by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''[Pokémon]'s shining armor boosted its Defense!''
* Dauntless Shield and Power of Alchemy additionally boost the bearer's Defense and Special Defense by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''The fairy king's shield protects [Pokémon]!''
** ''[Pokémon]'s shining armor boosted its Defense! [Pokémon]'s magical power boosted its Special Defense!''
* Fairy Aura additionally causes the user's moves to ignore accuracy checks.
* Intrepid Sword additionally boosts the bearer's Attack and Special Attack by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''The fairy king's sword empowered [Pokémon]!''
* Magic Bounce, Magic Guard, Mirror Armor, and Pastel Veil additionally boost the bearer's Special Defense by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''[Pokémon]'s magical power boosted its Special Defense!''
** ''[Pokémon]'s reflective armor boosted its Special Defense!''
* Magician additionally boosts the bearer's Special Attack by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''[Pokémon]'s magical power boosted its Special Attack!''
* Marvel Scale is activated.
* Mimicry changes the user's type to Fairy.
* Queenly Majesty additionally boosts the bearer's damage by 1.5x.
* Soul Heart additionally boosts the bearer's Special Defense by 1 stage on activation.
* Stance Change additionally boosts the bearer's Defense by 1 stage on switch-in and will boost and lower the user's Attack and Defense by 1 stage when switching between respective forms.
* Steely Spirit's damage boost is now 2x.

==Moves Affected==

===Moves which receive an attack buff===

* Draining Kiss → 2x boost.
** ''True love never hurt so badly!''
* Mist Ball → 2x boost.
** ''The magical energy strengthened the attack!''
* Smart Strike → 1.5x boost.
** ''The blade cuts true!''
* Ancient Power, Armor Cannon, Eerie Spell, Fleur Cannon, Magical Leaf, Menacing Moonraze Maelstrom, Moongeist Beam, Mystical Fire, Oceanic Operetta, Relic Song, Sparkling Aria → 1.5x boost.
** ''The magical energy strengthened the attack!''
* Behemoth Bash → 1.5x boost.
** ''The shield strikes true!''

===Other moves===

* Acid Armor boosts the user's Defense by 3 stages.
* Crafty Shield and Flower Shield additionally boost the user's Defense and Special Defense by one stage.
* Cut, Sacred Sword, Secret Sword, and Slash become Steel-type moves.
* Draining Kiss and Sweet Kiss additionally cure Sleep.
* Floral Healing restores 100% of the target's max HP.
* Forest's Curse additionally Curses the target.
* Healing Wish additionally boosts the receiver's Attack and Special Attack by 1 stage.
* King's Shield now protects from all moves and additionally lowers the attacker's Special Attack by 2 stages on contact.
* Miracle Eye additionally boosts Special Attack by 2 stages.
* Magic Powder turns the target into Psychic/Fairy type.
* Noble Roar lowers the target's Attack and Special Attack by 2 stages.
* Strange Steam always Confuses the target.
* Swords Dance boosts the user's Attack by 3 stages. 
* Wish restores 75% of the user's max HP.

===Field-dependent moves===

* Camouflage changes the user's type to Fairy.
* Nature Power becomes Secret Sword.
* Secret Power may inflict Sleep.
* Shelter halves damage from Fairy-type moves.
* Terrain Pulse's type becomes Fairy.

==Items==

* [[Magical Seed]] applies King's Shield to the user.

